WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:05.569
So Californium is another element which was
first prepared at the

00:00:05.569 --> 00:00:11.060
Berkeley labs in California. It’s got quite
a few military applications,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:15.370
usually involving the word ‘nuclear’.
But what most people don’t realise is

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:19.860
it’s actually used in various types of machines
for detecting metal fatigue

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.070
and stress in airplanes, so obviously it’s
pretty important our planes don’t

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.199
fall to bits in mid-air and they are used
in the kind of instruments which

00:00:27.199 --> 00:00:30.960
scan for this and can spot any problems long
before they become a

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:31.960
serious issue.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.070
It’s also probably the only other actinide
which has possibly routinely got

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:39.440
its way into households which is that it’s
also used in metal detectors.

